      "message": "test(ui): move pixel snapshots to the release lane; structural UI tests in the PR suite\n\nThe three PNG golden tests (egui_shell_snapshot, egui_shell_snapshot_light,\ntool_editor_snapshot) are #[ignore]d with a \"release lane (#255)\" reason\nand run only in a new ui snapshot lane of the release tier (gate.ps1 and\ngate.sh: debug, --lib --ignored snapshot, CWD crates/ui). Quick and batch\nno longer read or write crates/ui/tests/snapshots/*.png.\n\nTheir intent is covered in the default suite by egui_app::tests::structural\n(shell_structure_dark, shell_structure_light, tool_editor_structure):\nAccessKit labels/roles/disabled state/window presence plus the painted\nstrips' text and coarse placement - text-only and platform independent.\n\nAGENTS.md Testing, the PR-reviewer agent and the review-prs skill now say a\nPR must not change snapshot PNGs; they are regenerated once at the cut.\n#[test] count in crates/ui: 414 -> 417 (3 moved to ignored, 3 added).\n\nFixes #255\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
