      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'upstream/main' into issue/255-structural-ui-tests\n\nConflict: tests.rs module list (structural + #342 one_wcs + #343\nsetup_tree), both kept. #343 (PR #390) gave each setup its own WCS,\nStock, Machine, Post, Fixtures and Tool list rows, so the shell's\nstructural twin now asserts those rows (name + value painted as one\ntext) instead of the old flat G54 row - the structural test caught the\nlayout change as intended.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
